type: software
title: "A3D3 HDR Gravitational Wave Anomaly Detection Challenge"
abstract: "Supporting code for the A3D3 HDR Challenge on anomaly detection in gravitational-wave strain data from LIGO's O3 observations. Participants develop machine learning algorithms to identify anomalous transient gravitational-wave signals from unknown sources."
